From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xvisor TEE Implementation <tee@xvisor.org>
Date: Mon, 1 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add SMCCC, SMC virtualization, TEE virtualization and OP-TEE virtualization support

This patch implements SMCCC (ARM SMC Calling Convention), SMC virtualization,
TEE virtualization framework, and OP-TEE virtualization support in Xvisor,
based on Xen's implementation.

The implementation includes:
1. SMCCC definitions and virtualization handler
2. Generic TEE mediator framework
3. OP-TEE mediator implementation
4. Integration with guest lifecycle management
5. Support for secondary CPU initialization

Signed-off-by: Xvisor TEE Implementation <tee@xvisor.org>
---
